1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,625
A robot can copy a demonstration
机器人可以模仿示范。

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:05,325
But how does it learn from its own mistakes
但它怎样从自己的失误中学习？

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:09,025
That is the question behind π*0.6,
这就是 π*0.6 想解决的问题。

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,220
and its training recipe, RECAP
它采用的训练方法，叫 RECAP。

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:15,740
Let us follow the paper, from the architecture to the robot results
从框架到机器人结果，一起看原论文。

6
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,155
Start with Figure 3.
先看图 3。

7
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:22,855
Images, the task instruction, and joint states go into the model
图像、任务指令和关节状态输入模型。

8
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:25,475
Gemma 3 predicts the next subtask.
Gemma 3 预测下一步子任务。

9
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:29,855
The flow matching action expert then generates continuous action chunks
流匹配动作专家生成连续动作块。

10
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:33,295
Those joint and gripper commands run at 50Hz.
关节和夹爪指令以 50Hz 执行。

11
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:36,555
FAST adds a separate, discrete action training signal
FAST 提供独立的离散动作训练信号。

12
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:39,655
A stop gradient keeps the continuous action loss
停止梯度，让连续动作损失

13
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:42,330
from updating the shared vision language backbone
不会更新共享的视觉语言主干。

14
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:46,385
Now watch this box assembly clip from their website
看这段官网的装箱演示。

15
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,545
The robot starts on its own
机器人先自主执行。

16
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:51,265
A person can take over and correct a mistake
遇到失误时，人可以接管纠正。

17
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,145
The red and green borders show those two modes
红绿边框标出这两种执行状态。

18
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,020
Corrections and task success labels feed the next training round
纠错和成功标签进入下一轮训练。

19
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:02,235
Figure 4 shows how experience becomes a learning signal.
图 4：经验怎样变成学习信号。

20
00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:05,995
Each step has a time cost. Failure adds a penalty
每一步有时间成本，失败还有惩罚。

21
00:01:06,050 --> 00:01:10,115
The value model estimates the remaining cost of completing the task
价值模型估计完成任务的剩余代价。

22
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:13,995
After a mistake, value drops. After recovery, it rises
失误后价值下降，恢复后回升。

23
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:17,275
Rewards and value changes over the next few steps
随后几步的奖励和价值变化

24
00:01:17,330 --> 00:01:18,950
give us the action advantage
共同构成动作优势。

25
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:23,425
Back to Figure 3. This small indicator is the key.
回到图 3，关键是这个小标记。

26
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:26,585
It comes after the subtask, but before the actions
它位于子任务之后、动作之前。

27
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,825
So it changes action prediction
因此它影响的是动作预测。

28
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:34,365
For autonomous rollouts, advantages above the task specific threshold get a positive label
自主轨迹中，超过任务阈值的优势标为正。

29
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:37,185
Other rollout samples get a negative label
其余自主轨迹样本标为负。

30
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,525
Expert corrections are labeled positive
专家纠错样本则标为正。

31
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,825
Training keeps both kinds of experience
训练保留这两类经验。

32
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:45,140
At execution, we ask for the positive condition
执行时，指定正优势条件。

33
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:49,355
Equation 4 connects that condition to action training.
公式 4 把优势条件接入动作训练。

34
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:51,855
Discrete actions use cross entropy
离散动作用交叉熵。

35
00:01:51,910 --> 00:01:54,875
Continuous actions use the flow matching loss
连续动作用流匹配损失。

36
00:01:54,930 --> 00:01:58,755
This lets RECAP use the existing generative training recipe,
RECAP 可以沿用生成动作训练方式，

37
00:01:58,810 --> 00:02:02,850
without directly computing an exact continuous action likelihood
绕开直接计算精确连续动作似然。

38
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:08,405
Figure 11: the same robot data for T-shirts and shorts.
图 11：同一批恤衫和短裤机器人数据。

39
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:12,125
RECAP completes about 60 successful tasks per hour.
RECAP 每小时成功完成约 60 次。

40
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:14,545
AWR completes about 30.
AWR 约 30 次。

41
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:17,265
Their success rates, on the right, are fairly close
右侧的成功率却比较接近。

42
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:20,165
The useful difference here is execution speed,
这里有信息量的差异，是执行速度，

43
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:22,500
as well as whether the task succeeds
它和任务能否成功，需要一起看。

44
00:02:23,330 --> 00:02:26,495
Figure 7 gives us the task-level results.
图 7 展示具体任务的结果。

45
00:02:26,550 --> 00:02:29,595
Coffee throughput rises from 14.7
咖啡吞吐量从 14.7 次/h，

46
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:31,915
to 28.8 successes per hour.
提高到 28.8 次/h。

47
00:02:31,970 --> 00:02:34,975
For the hardest button down shirt in diverse laundry,
多样衣物中最难的纽扣衬衫，

48
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:38,295
it rises from 3.85 to 8.3 successes per hour.
从 3.85 提高到 8.3 次/h。

49
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:42,915
Baseline: offline RL plus demonstration fine-tuning.
对照是离线强化学习加示范微调。

50
00:02:42,970 --> 00:02:45,475
The website clips show the motions
官网片段帮助我们看动作过程。

51
00:02:45,530 --> 00:02:48,210
These plots are the evidence for the improvement
这些实验图，才是提升的定量证据。

52
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,345
Finally, look at the training loop
最后看训练循环。

53
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:56,585
Collect experience, update the value model, then retrain the policy offline
收集经验、更新价值模型、离线重训策略。

54
00:02:56,640 --> 00:03:01,525
It still needs human success labels, corrections, and environment resets
仍需人工成功标签、纠错和环境重置。

55
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:05,405
The contribution is a practical way to feed real task feedback
它把真实任务反馈，

56
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:09,540
into VLA action training, and improve over successive rounds.
接入 VLA 动作训练，逐轮改进。
